    "* Enlace al notebook a Google Colab: [![Open In Colab](https://colab.research.google.com/assets/colab-badge.svg)](https://colab.research.google.com/github/aoliverg/python/blob/master/notebooks/cap2-spa.ipynb)"
   ]
  },
  {
